            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>As part of the complex management of obese patients, dieticians carry out a detailed analysis of their dietary behaviour. Taking into account various elements relating or not to the condition, they identify areas to work on, in particular through individual or collective therapeutic education.</AbstractText>
